{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"attributed"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/AttributedStyle","text":"AttributedStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE15AttributedStyleV"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance to customize the lexical"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"representation of a date as a string. Use the format style’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"attributed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property to customize the visual representation of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"date as a string. Attributed strings can represent the subcomponent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"characters, words, and phrases of a string with a custom combination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of font size, weight, and color.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, the function below uses a date format style to create a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"custom lexical representation of a date, then retrieves an attributed"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"string representation of the same date and applies a visual emphasis"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the year component of the date.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["private func makeAttributedString() -> AttributedString {","    let date = Date()","    let formatStyle = Date.FormatStyle(date: .abbreviated, time: .standard)","    var attributedString = formatStyle.attributed.format(date)","    for run in attributedString.runs {","        if let dateFieldAttribute = run.attributes.foundation.dateField,","           dateFieldAttribute == .year {","            attributedString[run.range].inlinePresentationIntent = [.emphasized, .stronglyEmphasized]","        }","    }","    return attributedString","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"deprecationSummary":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use attributedStyle instead"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle\/attributed-swift.property"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"attributed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE15AttributedStyleV","text":"AttributedStyle"}],"externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV10attributedAcDE010AttributedF0Vvp","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"message":"Use attributedStyle instead","deprecatedAt":"18.0","name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"message":"Use attributedStyle instead","deprecatedAt":"18.0","name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":f